\f1\fs22 The gates opened and Johnny drove Shakti ground car north towards town, through the bush, around the golf course and past the stately properties bordered by stately trees that hid stately, multi-storey second residences. He had no license to drive, having never needed one above the Layer in the city, or on the few stressful occasions he was compelled to travel below it. He gripped the top of the steering wheel with clawed, white-knuckled fingers like an octogenarian who had lost their spectacles in the middle of a particularly ill-advised amusement park ride.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

