\f1\fs22 Within a kilometre, he became terrified of left turns, mostly because the gutters kept jumping out at him as he tried to figure just where the tax they were. He barked at the Smuggle Maps app in the console and demanded it find a route to his rendezvous using only right turns. The app displayed a map on the centre console with three routes displayed and spoke, \'93I have found routes to the crematorium with minimal left turns that require you to drive off only one cliff each. Would you like me to notify the ambulance service now?\'94\
Johnny regretted not using one of Eloise\'92s drivers or even risking one of the autonomous vehicles, but that would leave a bigger data fingerprint of his trip.\
\'93Tax!\'94 he swore. \'93Eloise is probably watching right now, and is controlling the damn steering. Stop driving me into gutters!\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl220\sb220\qj\partightenfactor0

